#: 46253551c3ad4c5987f757ee2da2cdcb
msgid "it declares a 'hal' variable as a reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:82
#: 9e99a24d302546b6b811304257e201d9
msgid "the code is quite rough and not well commented"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:83
#: e1faaf728aca4b87b9701bba44b911dd
msgid "the setup() and loop() functions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:86
#: 612abdc9e509482286c40107d3fae619
msgid "The hal reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:88
#: fcae2ef511d54533ad12540eaf0548e1
msgid "Every file that uses features of the AP_HAL needs to declare a hal reference. That gives access to a AP_HAL::HAL object, which provides access to all hardware specific functions, including things like printing messages to the console, sleeping and talking to I2C and SPI buses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:94
#: fd9e1dc144d14e4a94d7ec8e9c1f4657
msgid "The actual hal variable is buried inside the board specific AP_HAL_XXX libraries. The reference in each file just provides a convenient way to get at the hal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:98
#: 64618d2e9d474a56bb90d2b6d0b40bb6
msgid "The most commonly used hal functions are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:100
#: 79c59d632e7a4cecb0a84d36f494c675
msgid "hal.console->printf() to print strings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:101
#: 84bb5dd0706b4c54aa0ee3f915b2382a
msgid "AP_HAL::millis() and AP_HAL::micros() to get the time since boot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:103
#: fbb7aa6fa5964e9795419829e2eb591c
msgid "hal.scheduler->delay() and hal.scheduler->delay_microseconds() to sleep for a short time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:105
#: dbe0b00fe559444dac2ef5686be1aae1
msgid "hal.gpio->pinMode(), hal.gpio->read() and hal.gpio->write() for accessing GPIO pins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:107
#: 08d58713e3b744429b9e8b3e05de1d6d
msgid "I2C access via hal.i2c"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:108
#: 6e4826c8b5274e69bb05361ba1c88de4
msgid "SPI access via hal.spi"
msgstr ""

